# WP-SRC-ALTITUDE (owner 10-06, the plane): the loading range reaches a cell in 3D - the distance from a source
# to the box a cell's streaming bounds make with the Y span of what it holds (Rules::PlannedCell::Height, UE's cell
# content bounds Z; WorldPartitionStreamingRules.hpp THE RULE, WithAltitude). World: Scenes/WP_Protocol
# (WP-PROTOCOL.scn): Main 25 m cells / 200 m range, Foliage 12.8 m / 64 m, LandscapeTiles 50 m / 510 m; HLOD_Main
# 512 m cells / 1024 m, its parent HLOD_Main_Far always resident; Foliage/Landscape HLODs always resident.
# Source: the Plane 9000002 (Y 50 m, TargetGrids Main+Foliage, Scripts/World/WPFly.lua +X 125 m/s for 8 s); the
# Player 9000001 off. Its shape is raised by StreamingSourceData.ShapeOffset.y (the shape's Location.y now places
# the shape's altitude): 195000 = 2 km above the ground.
# Expected by phase (editor.log "[WorldPartition] 'WP_Protocol': ..."):
#   2 km: every Main and Foliage cell Load All kept is "unloaded." and none is "loaded" again while the source is
#         up there; HLOD_Main cells unloaded too (1024 m < 2 km); the game never blocks behind the loading
#         overlay (StreamingPerformance CellHolds: under the feet only when also reached);
#   50 m: the Main/Foliage cells around the plane "loaded" again, the zone on the WP map a full circle.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Load All"
Дано set 9000001 StreamingSourceData.Enabled false
Дано set 9000002 StreamingSourceData.Enabled true
Дано set 9000002 StreamingSourceData.ShapeOffset 0,195000,0
Дано set 1003 CameraData.Far 800000
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда advance 3
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,200000,-150000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,0.75
Когда advance 2
# Тогда [кадр]: alt_2km - the city from 2 km: merged HLOD_Main_Far blocks + landscape HLOD + foliage HLOD, no hole and no
# doubled block anywhere; the WP map shows no Main/Foliage cell loaded under the plane; no loading overlay.
Тогда alt_2km город с 2 км: слитые блоки HLOD_Main_Far + HLOD ландшафта и листвы, без дыр и без двойных блоков; на карте WP под самолётом нет загруженных ячеек Main/Foliage; оверлея загрузки нет; лог: ячейки Main/Foliage unloaded, ни одной loaded
Когда run Action "Stop"
Дано set 9000002 StreamingSourceData.ShapeOffset 0,0,0
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда advance 3
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,40000,-40000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,1
Когда advance 2
# Тогда [кадр]: alt_50m - the same plane at 50 m: the Main cells within ~190 m and the Foliage cells within ~40 m of it
# are real (loaded) again, HLOD beyond; the WP map zone a circle around the plane.
Тогда alt_50m самолёт на 50 м: ячейки Main в ~190 м и Foliage в ~40 м вокруг него снова настоящие (loaded), дальше HLOD; на карте WP зона - круг вокруг самолёта
Когда run Action "Stop"
